    "detailed_description": "<h1>Get our latest game</h1><p></p><br><h1>Talk to developers on Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/e77d39c5728c043fcf541e7be0f1728c.avif?t=1693315746\" /></div><br><br>Lewd Island is a unique visual novel that will put your survival skills to the test, uncover secrets, break and form everlasting bonds, while showing you that love wears many faces.<br><br>In Lewd Island, you are stranded on a deserted island with a young woman and all you're trying to do is survive. But what if you find more than you bargained for on that island? <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/54446098a31c50995033c383f6a7a1a9.poster.avif?t=1693315746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/54446098a31c50995033c383f6a7a1a9.webm?t=1693315746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/54446098a31c50995033c383f6a7a1a9.mp4?t=1693315746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Is it possible to find love amongst the wreckage of your fragmented mind?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/bdc3f074b291a5933909b09e18332a97.poster.avif?t=1693315746\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/bdc3f074b291a5933909b09e18332a97.webm?t=1693315746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498120/extras/bdc3f074b291a5933909b09e18332a97.mp4?t=1693315746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div